# Spellbook Vendor (a 2/2): "When you do, create a Sorcerer Role token attached to target creature you control. (If you control
# another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard.)" (CR 303.7a, 704.5z). Turn 3 Bot1 pays {1} and the Sorcerer Role goes on
# its Memnite (2/2). Turn 5 it pays again and targets the same Memnite: of its two Sorcerer Roles only the newer one stays, the
# older one going to the graveyard (and ceasing to exist, CR 111.7), so the Memnite is still a 2/2, not a 3/3.
# The Vendor then attacks and, having vigilance (CR 702.20b), does not tap.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Spellbook Vendor
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

